    "close_code": "Solved (Permanently)",
    "close_notes": "checkout-api rolled back to 2.14.2 (Jenkins checkout-api-deploy #898, 14:40 to 14:42 UTC); errors back to baseline from 14:43 UTC. Cause: the logging library bump in 2.14.3 made the audit appender synchronous inside the submit transaction; with the DEBUG flood from the same release the log sink took about 10 s a write, so submits held their checkout-db connections about 30 s and the 40-connection pool on every 2.14.3 pod ran out. Submits that waited 5 s for a connection got a 504. 2.14.3 is parked until the appender is asynchronous again. Problem record to follow.",
